<body>
<div class="app">
<header class="topbar"><div class="brand"><div class="brand-mark">🍃</div><div><h1>Wildgrove</h1><small>creature trails</small></div></div><div class="top-meta"><div class="pill">☀️ <span>Day <b>01</b> · Meadow</span></div><div class="pill"><span class="avatar">🧢</span> <b>Ranger</b></div></div></header>
<main class="layout">
<section class="left-column"><div class="scene-card"><div class="scene-wrap"><canvas id="world" width="900" height="565" aria-label="Explore the Wildgrove meadow"></canvas><div class="scene-label"><div class="sun">☀</div><div class="area"><span id="biomeTitle">SUNPETAL MEADOW</span><small id="biomeRoute">Wildgrove · Route 01</small></div></div><div class="scene-actions"><button class="icon-btn" id="soundBtn" title="Toggle sound">♫</button><button class="icon-btn" id="helpBtn" title="How to play">?</button></div><nav class="biome-nav" aria-label="Choose a biome"><button data-biome="meadow" class="selected">🌼 Meadow</button><button data-biome="tide">🌊 Coast</button><button data-biome="ember">🌋 Ridge</button><button data-biome="moon">🌙 Moonwood</button></nav><div class="scene-hint" id="sceneHint">WASD or arrow keys to explore</div>
<div class="battle-layer" id="battleLayer"><div class="battle-ground"></div><div class="battle-top" id="playerBattleCard"></div><div class="battle-top foe-card" id="foeBattleCard"></div><div class="battle-creature" id="foeArt"></div><div class="player-creature" id="playerArt"></div><div class="battle-log" id="battleLog"></div><div class="battle-controls" id="battleControls"></div></div>
<div class="starter-screen show" id="starterScreen"><div class="starter-box"><div class="welcome-icon">🌼</div><h2>A little adventure awaits</h2><p>Choose your first trail companion. The Sunpetal Meadow is full of curious creatures waiting to meet you.</p><div class="starter-options" id="starterOptions"><button class="starter-choice" data-id="mossling"><div class="starter-art"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" role="img" aria-label="Mossling" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><ellipse cx="50" cy="88" rx="27" ry="5" fill="#55724b" opacity=".15"></ellipse><g fill="#80bb74" stroke="#375d4a" stroke-width="3" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round"><ellipse cx="50" cy="57" rx="27" ry="26"></ellipse></g><g><ellipse cx="50" cy="69" rx="17" ry="10" fill="#d5ecab"></ellipse><path d="M48 38Q39 13 27 21Q30 37 47 43M53 38Q60 12 74 19Q71 36 55 43" fill="#98c97a" stroke="#527d55" stroke-width="2"></path></g><ellipse cx="42" cy="56" rx="3" ry="4" fill="#243f3d"></ellipse><ellipse cx="59" cy="56" rx="3" ry="4" fill="#243f3d"></ellipse><path d="M47 65q3 3 6 0" fill="none" stroke="#654d46" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></div><strong>Mossling</strong><small>A tiny sprout with a brave heart.</small><span class="type-tag">Leaf type</span></button><button class="starter-choice" data-id="embercub"><div class="starter-art"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" role="img" aria-label="Embercub" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><ellipse cx="50" cy="88" rx="27" ry="5" fill="#55724b" opacity=".15"></ellipse><g fill="#e78d62" stroke="#375d4a" stroke-width="3" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M28 47 20 15 43 34 56 34 80 14 73 49Q84 65 70 77L34 77Q18 67 28 47Z"></path></g><g><path d="m25 25 13 13M74 25 63 39" stroke="#ffd18a" stroke-width="6"></path><path d="M24 72Q7 73 13 57Q19 50 27 59" fill="#e78d62" stroke="#375d4a" stroke-width="3"></path></g><ellipse cx="42" cy="56" rx="3" ry="4" fill="#243f3d"></ellipse><ellipse cx="59" cy="56" rx="3" ry="4" fill="#243f3d"></ellipse><path d="M47 65q3 3 6 0" fill="none" stroke="#654d46" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></div><strong>Embercub</strong><small>A warm little spark with quick paws.</small><span class="type-tag">Ember type</span></button><button class="starter-choice" data-id="brookfin"><div class="starter-art"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" role="img" aria-label="Brookfin" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><ellipse cx="50" cy="88" rx="27" ry="5" fill="#55724b" opacity=".15"></ellipse><g fill="#64a8c0" stroke="#375d4a" stroke-width="3" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M29 54Q46 25 72 43L89 30 88 74 71 64Q47 82 29 54Z"></path><path d="M43 40Q40 22 53 24Q64 29 57 42Z"></path></g><g><path d="M62 50q12 8 0 16" fill="none" stroke="#4d8793" stroke-width="3"></path><path d="M37 53q8 6 0 12" fill="none" stroke="#b6e8df" stroke-width="3"></path></g><ellipse cx="42" cy="56" rx="3" ry="4" fill="#243f3d"></ellipse><ellipse cx="59" cy="56" rx="3" ry="4" fill="#243f3d"></ellipse><path d="M47 65q3 3 6 0" fill="none" stroke="#654d46" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></div><strong>Brookfin</strong><small>It hums softly beside clear streams.</small><span class="type-tag">Tide type</span></button></div></div></div>
